            <abstract>
                <p>General record for medical and magic prescriptions in Amharic against various
                    diseases and evil spirits, e.g., migraine (<foreign xml:lang="am">ራስ፡
                        ፍልፀት፡</foreign>), colic (<foreign xml:lang="am">ሆድ፡ ቍርፀት፡</foreign>), čǝfe
                        (<foreign xml:lang="am">ችፌ፡</foreign>), pain in urination (<foreign
                        xml:lang="am">ሽንት፡ ምጽ፡</foreign>), scrofula (<foreign xml:lang="am"
                        >ነቀርሳ፡</foreign>), fever (<foreign xml:lang="am">ንዳድ፡</foreign>), syphilis
                        (<foreign xml:lang="am">ቂጥኝ፡</foreign>), falling on the battlefield
                        (<foreign xml:lang="am">የሜዳ፡ ውድቀት፡</foreign>), the 'children of the Zār'
                        (<foreign xml:lang="am">የዛር፡ ውላጅ፡</foreign>), albugo (<foreign xml:lang="am"
                        >ከዓይኑ፡ በጣለበት፡</foreign>), corrosive leprosy (<foreign
                        xml:lang="am">ደዌ፡ ሥጋ፡</foreign>), tapeworm (<foreign xml:lang="am"
                        >ኮሶ፡</foreign>), if a horse grows thin (<foreign xml:lang="am">ፈረስ፡
                        እየከሳ፡</foreign>), baldness (<foreign xml:lang="am">ቧሄ፡</foreign>), pain in
                    labour (<foreign xml:lang="am">ምጽ፡</foreign>), the shadow (<foreign
                        xml:lang="am">ጥላ፡</foreign>), fire (<foreign xml:lang="am"
                    >እሳት፡</foreign>),
                    conjunctivitis (<foreign xml:lang="am">ዓይን፡ ማዝ፡</foreign>), hemeralopy
                        (<foreign xml:lang="am">ዳፍንት፡</foreign>), jaundice (<foreign xml:lang="am"
                        >የወፍ፡ በሽታ፡</foreign>), horse scrofula (<foreign xml:lang="am">የፈረስ፡
                        ነቀርሳ፡</foreign>), rheumatism (<foreign xml:lang="am">ቍርጥማት፡</foreign>), and
                    skin disease (<foreign xml:lang="am">መድየት፡</foreign>), for a person biten by a snake (<foreign xml:lang="am">የእባብ፡ ለነከሰው፡</foreign>),  for a person whose hair grew on [in the eye] (<foreign
                        xml:lang="am">ጠጉር፡ ለበቀለበት፡</foreign>),
                    as well as for other
                    different purposes, e,g., for love (<foreign xml:lang="am">ለፍቅር፡</foreign>), for
                    becoming rich (<foreign xml:lang="am">ለአስተጋብኦ፡ ንዋይ፡</foreign>), for a success at
                    the market (<foreign xml:lang="am">ገበያ፡</foreign>), against thieves
                    working through magic (<foreign xml:lang="am">ሰላቢ፡</foreign>). Occasionaly, the
                    prescription purpose may be not specified. In this case, the note contains only
                    ingredients.</p>
            </abstract>
